WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
Young Master, this is an errand assigned to you by the Emperor.

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,000
It doesn't matter, the emperor can't keep staring at me, right?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,960
Just for a few days

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,160
I'll go there when I'm done with my work.

5
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:12,290
Lian'er is now making money to redeem the land.

6
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:13,690
That's the biggest thing

7
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:28,320
I have to go and get the glass vase first, so I’ll spare you, Mr. Fang, okay?

8
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,880
Is your young master here or not?

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,520
Our young master is out

10
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,640
When I was with you, Mr. Feng,

11
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,240
were expelled from Taixue together

12
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,080
Now I can’t go to school

13
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,480
Why aren't you in the mansion?

14
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,560
Mr. Fang, I’ll tell you the truth

15
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,960
It's the master's order

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:51,460
My young master is not allowed to come and go with you. Don't worry, housekeeper.

17
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,420
Could you please go in and let me know?

18
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,260
Just say that Fang Yang is here this time

19
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,620
It’s to make money with Mr. Chen

20
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:06,720
Then I'll go in and inform Mr. Fang.

21
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,160
My master asked me to bring you a message
